@startuml DFD_Level1
title **DFD Model — Level 1**

skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam arrowColor #1F2937
skinparam arrowThickness 1.2
skinparam arrowFontSize 8

skinparam rectangle<<ent>> {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  RoundCorner 0
  FontStyle bold
  FontSize 11
}
skinparam rectangle<<proc>> {
  BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
  BorderColor #2563EB
  RoundCorner 12
  FontStyle bold
  FontSize 10
}
skinparam rectangle<<ds>> {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  RoundCorner 0
  FontSize 9
}

top to bottom direction

'─── External Entities ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
rectangle "School\nAdmin" as ADM <<ent>>
rectangle "Teacher"       as TCH <<ent>>
rectangle "Student"       as STU <<ent>>
rectangle "Parent"        as PAR <<ent>>

'─── Processes ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
rectangle "1\nSetup Trip\n& Geofence"            as P1 <<proc>>
rectangle "2\nManage Student\n& Parent Info"     as P2 <<proc>>
rectangle "3\nLog Attendance\n& GPS"             as P3 <<proc>>
rectangle "4\nMonitor\nGeofence"                 as P4 <<proc>>
rectangle "5\nTrigger\nSOS"                      as P5 <<proc>>
rectangle "6\nChat & Direct\nMessaging"          as P6 <<proc>>
rectangle "7\nGenerate\nReports"                 as P7 <<proc>>

'─── Data Stores ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
rectangle "D1  |  Trip Details"                       as D1 <<ds>>
rectangle "D2  |  Student & Parent Information"       as D2 <<ds>>
rectangle "D3  |  Attendance Records"                 as D3 <<ds>>
rectangle "D4  |  Chat History"                       as D4 <<ds>>
rectangle "D5  |  SOS & Geofence Alerts"              as D5 <<ds>>
rectangle "D6  |  GPS Location Data"                  as D6 <<ds>>
rectangle "D7  |  Reports Log"                        as D7 <<ds>>

'─── Process 1: Setup Trip & Geofence ───────────────────────────────────────────
ADM --> P1 : fieldtrip details\n(destination, date, time)
ADM --> P1 : geofence coordinates\n(1–4000m per stop)
P1  --> D1 : trip & geofence data
P1  --> TCH : trip itinerary
P1  --> STU : trip itinerary
P1  --> PAR : trip notification

'─── Process 2: Manage Student & Parent Info ────────────────────────────────────
STU --> P2 : QR display / approve link
PAR --> P2 : link request (QR scan / LRN)
TCH --> P2 : view student list & QR
P2  --> D2 : student & parent records
D2  --> P2 : student & parent data
P2  --> STU : identity QR code & text code
P2  --> TCH : student & parent info

'─── Process 3: Log Attendance & GPS ────────────────────────────────────────────
STU --> P3 : GPS location data
TCH --> P3 : QR scan (attendance marking)
D1  --> P3 : trip schedule
D2  --> P3 : student profile data
P3  --> D3 : attendance record (QR + GPS + timestamp)
P3  --> D6 : GPS location data
P3  --> TCH : attendance status update

'─── Process 4: Monitor Geofence ────────────────────────────────────────────────
D6  --> P4 : GPS data stream
D1  --> P4 : geofence boundaries
P4  --> TCH : geofence alert (alarm)
P4  --> STU : geofence warning (alarm until re-entry)
P4  --> D5 : alert record

'─── Process 5: Trigger SOS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
STU --> P5 : SOS manual trigger
P5  --> TCH : SOS notification
P5  --> PAR : SOS notification
P5  --> D5 : SOS alert record

'─── Process 6: Chat & Direct Messaging ─────────────────────────────────────────
STU --> P6 : chat messages & replies
TCH --> P6 : chat & direct messages
PAR --> P6 : chat messages & replies
ADM --> P6 : communication via chat
P6  --> D4 : save chat history
D4  --> P6 : retrieve chat history
P6  --> STU : messages delivered
P6  --> TCH : messages delivered
P6  --> PAR : messages delivered
P6  --> ADM : messages delivered

'─── Process 7: Generate Reports ────────────────────────────────────────────────
ADM --> P7 : filter parameters\n(date, teacher, bus number)
D1  --> P7 : trip details
D3  --> P7 : attendance data
D5  --> P7 : geofence violations & SOS data
P7  --> ADM : generated PDF report
P7  --> D7 : report record

@enduml
